From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 23:03:19 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign calendar, profile, locations, knowledge base and
 reports pages

Neutral grey ground, rounded white cards, Anuphan/IBM Plex Sans Thai type,
ACT crimson reserved for primary actions. Sidebar unchanged. Calendar gains
Thai month/day names and a month agenda panel; knowledge base gains category
chips; reports move export actions to the page header.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
